#: ../../electronic/density_matrix_analysis.rst:2
msgid "密度行列と化学結合の解析"
msgstr "Density Matrix and Chemical Bonding Analysis"

#: ../../electronic/density_matrix_analysis.rst:4
msgid "Löwdin解析で原子ごとの電子数やスピンの分布を評価し、射影状態密度で状態密度を軌道ごとに分けて電子がどのエネルギーの状態に入っているかを読み取り、結合次数を使って原子間の結合を調べます。"
msgstr ""
"This chapter uses Löwdin analysis to estimate atomic electron populations"
" and the distribution of spin. It uses the projected density of states to"
" resolve the density of states by orbital and show the energies of the "
"states that electrons occupy. It then uses bond orders to examine bonding"
" between atoms."

